1
00:00:01,325 --> 00:00:02,200
现在怎么办
What do we do now?

2
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:06,367
我们跟紧计划
We stick to the plan.

3
00:00:06,409 --> 00:00:07,200
怎样跟紧
How?

4
00:00:07,242 --> 00:00:10,409
没有通讯系统 我们就没法告诉整个擎天
Without the CCT there's no way we can tell all of Atlas

5
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,992
去踏入这么一个诡异的门
to just step into a bunch of freaky, magic doors.

6
00:00:13,034 --> 00:00:13,742
有法子了
But there is.

7
00:00:13,784 --> 00:00:16,867
我们自己用传送门亲自传递信息
We use the portals ourselves,and spread the word on foot.

8
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:20,159
这东西真管用吗
Are we positive these things work?

9
00:00:36,659 --> 00:00:38,492
好吧 我们能行的
Okay, we can do this.

10
00:00:38,992 --> 00:00:40,409
Nora和我引导人们通过大门
Nora and I will get people through the gates.

11
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:41,950
其他人坚守自己职责
Everyone else, keep to your roles.

12
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:46,742
记住 疏散是第一优先 天塌下来都不管
Remember, the evacuation is priority one no matter what else happens.

13
00:00:47,242 --> 00:00:48,409
你确定你不需要更多帮助
You sure you won't need more help?

14
00:00:48,492 --> 00:00:51,492
遮阳学院都是武装到牙齿的猎人们
Shade is armed to the teeth with Huntsmen and Huntresses.

15
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:55,200
但我们要把一王国的负面情绪都扔到他们门面
but we're about to throw a kingdom's worth of negativity on their doorstep.

16
00:00:55,617 --> 00:00:57,909
如果有人能帮忙 就是他们了
If anyone will need help, it's them.

17
00:01:15,034 --> 00:01:16,117
什么东西
What is it?

18
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:27,075
各位
Everyone.

19
00:01:27,117 --> 00:01:27,700
啊
Ow!

20
00:01:32,534 --> 00:01:35,700
请你们注意听
I'm uh- gonna need your attention.

21
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,284
继续走
Keep moving, come on.

22
00:01:50,325 --> 00:01:52,325
小心脚下
That's it, watch your step.

23
00:01:53,409 --> 00:01:55,242
别推揉
Hey, no pushing.

24
00:01:56,742 --> 00:01:58,450
就知道你们不会让我们失望的
Figured you wouldn't let us down.

25
00:01:59,492 --> 00:02:01,575
我以为会更多人进来避难
I thought there'd be more people by now.

26
00:02:01,617 --> 00:02:04,284
我们的工作是护送Penny和神杖去真空王国
Our job is getting Penny and the Staff to Vacuo.

27
00:02:04,534 --> 00:02:06,700
在那之前 我们得相信同伴们的能力
Until then, we have to trust the others

28
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,409
我相信他们能应付的
I'm sure they can handle it.

29
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:11,992
我们应该会到达真空的城市外缘
We should end up just outside the city limits of Vacuo.

30
00:02:12,325 --> 00:02:15,367
能容纳足够的难民 但还接收得到通信信号
Enough space for refugees but still within range of communication

31
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:18,784
行吧 我会尽力遮蔽人们的情绪
All right, I'll focus on masking emotions for as long as I can.

32
00:02:18,825 --> 00:02:20,534
等通过传送门就求援
Call for help as soon as we cross.

33
00:02:25,325 --> 00:02:27,117
你逗我吧
You've gotta be kidding me.

34
00:02:28,117 --> 00:02:29,409
城市在哪边
Which way is the city?

35
00:02:29,784 --> 00:02:31,450
肯定在附近的
It has to be here somewhere.

36
00:02:32,075 --> 00:02:36,075
同志们 沙尘暴干扰的不仅是能见度
Guys, the sandstorm isn't just killing visibility.

37
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,492
我们在哪里
Where are we?

38
00:02:43,409 --> 00:02:44,200
欢迎来到
Welcome...

39
00:02:44,909 --> 00:02:45,825
真空王国
to Vacuo.

40
00:02:47,242 --> 00:02:50,034
继续走 跟所有人到出口去
Head down and follow everyone else to the exit.

41
00:03:00,784 --> 00:03:01,450
不
No.

42
00:03:01,492 --> 00:03:03,325
继续走 我们来对付她
Keep going, we'll handle this.

43
00:03:17,534 --> 00:03:19,909
你们的奥斯卡小朋友是对的
Your little friend Oscar was right.

44
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:23,159
不过最简单的部分结束了
But the easy part ends here.

45
00:03:25,784 --> 00:03:27,950
“你怎么知道"
How did you know about that?

46
00:03:32,117 --> 00:03:33,742
妮奥波莉丹对吧
Neopolitan, was it?

47
00:03:34,575 --> 00:03:36,575
现在可不是积怨的时候
Now isn't the time to hold grudges.

48
00:03:36,617 --> 00:03:39,242
不 她生气是对的
No, she's right to be angry.

49
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:44,950
我知道我还没履行承诺
I know I haven't upheld my end of the bargain.

50
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,742
我很抱歉
I'm sorry.

51
00:03:50,784 --> 00:03:53,784
我今天就会把Ruby Rose给你的
I will get you Ruby Rose today.

52
00:03:54,117 --> 00:03:58,117
但为了实现这点 我需要问神灯一个问题
But to do that, I need to ask the lamp a question.

53
00:04:20,242 --> 00:04:21,034
珍
Jinn.

54
00:04:22,784 --> 00:04:24,534
你有问题要问我吗
You have a question for me?

55
00:04:25,534 --> 00:04:26,575
确实有
I do.

56
00:04:28,409 --> 00:04:31,284
Ruby一伙人在计划什么
What have Ruby and her teammates planned?

57
00:04:41,450 --> 00:04:44,117
我们一直在确保宝库是关闭的
We've been so worried about keeping the Vault closed that...

58
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:46,784
却从来没想到要用里面的东西
we never considered using what's inside.

59
00:04:47,617 --> 00:04:49,034
创造之杖
the Staff of creation.

60
00:04:49,075 --> 00:04:54,075
也许我们可以用它来救Penny和让擎天曼特人都安全
Maybe we can use it to save/Penny and get everyone in Atlas and Mantle back to safety.

61
00:04:58,617 --> 00:05:00,617
你们播送撤离指令后
After you guys broadcast the evac procedure,

62
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:03,117
你们通过泛大陆通讯系统中心的传送门
you'll walk through the portal at the CCT Center.

63
00:05:03,659 --> 00:05:04,742
然后我们搞定宝库
And then we're done in the Vault,

64
00:05:04,784 --> 00:05:06,284
我们带走Penny和神杖
we'll take Penny and the Staff.

65
00:05:07,367 --> 00:05:10,450
你仅靠智慧就击垮了这个王国
You tore this kingdom apart with nothing but your intellect.

66
00:05:11,659 --> 00:05:14,075
不如我们来把你的大业完成了吧
How about we finish what you started?

67
00:05:32,825 --> 00:05:34,284
你拿到你要的东西了吗
You have everything you need?

68
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:39,867
相信我 这就是我梦寐以求的东西
Oh believe me, this is everything I've ever wanted.

69
00:05:46,742 --> 00:05:48,867
你应得的 亚瑟
You deserve this Arthur.

70
00:05:50,784 --> 00:05:51,742
我们会回来的
We'll be back.

71
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:58,950
你在直播
You're live.

72
00:05:59,242 --> 00:06:01,242
所有人能看到你
Everyone can-see you.

73
00:06:04,242 --> 00:06:06,742
擎天曼特的市民们
Citizens of Atlas, Mantle,

74
00:06:07,284 --> 00:06:11,784
我们必须告诉你一件重要的事 擎天在坠落
what we have to tell you is very important.Atlas is falling.

75
00:06:12,075 --> 00:06:12,992
但
But -

76
00:06:21,617 --> 00:06:23,159
他们用了神杖?
They're using the Staff?

77
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,825
他们疯了吗?
Are they crazy?

78
00:06:26,117 --> 00:06:27,659
他们会毁了这个王国
They'll destroy the kingdom.

79
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,617
你觉得一个王国应该是什么?
What do you think a kingdom is?

80
00:06:29,659 --> 00:06:32,450
是它的人民 还是他们所居住的那块破地
The people, or just the chunk of land they live on.

81
00:06:32,784 --> 00:06:34,950
无论如何 这事都结束了
Either way, it's over now.

82
00:06:34,992 --> 00:06:36,284
埃隆伍德被击败了
Ironwood's down.

83
00:06:54,784 --> 00:06:55,325
不!
No!

84
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:36,409
你可终于醒了
Well I see you're awake finally.

85
00:07:36,992 --> 00:07:39,575
在你的治下 擎天已经陨落了
Atlas is falling under your watch.,

86
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,034
感觉如何啊 詹姆斯?
How does it feel James?

87
00:07:43,659 --> 00:07:46,450
他们 他们拿到了神杖
They- they've got the Staff.

88
00:07:46,950 --> 00:07:47,700
对啊
That's right.

89
00:07:47,742 --> 00:07:49,367
你输了
You lose.

90
00:07:50,117 --> 00:07:51,700
我们都输了
We both lose.

91
00:08:05,909 --> 00:08:06,534
什么?
What?

92
00:08:22,034 --> 00:08:25,575
你 你也会把我的牢门打开 对吧?
You're - you're going to open mine too, right?

93
00:08:35,534 --> 00:08:36,284
当然
Sure thing.

94
00:08:56,450 --> 00:08:58,409
我知道你的计划会异想天开
I knew your plan would be bold.

95
00:08:58,450 --> 00:09:01,200
但我可绝对猜不到会是这样
But I never could have predicted all of this.

96
00:09:01,784 --> 00:09:04,409
至少没有珍的话是绝对猜不到的
At least not without a little help from Jinn.

97
00:09:04,909 --> 00:09:09,117
我想我还得谢谢你们为我上的最后一课
I suppose I have all of you to thank for one last lesson.

98
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:12,409
如果想要赢的话
Sometimes if you want to win,

99
00:09:14,617 --> 00:09:17,367
不能孤军奋战
you simply can't do it alone.

100
00:09:18,659 --> 00:09:19,450
Ruby!
Ruby!

101
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:02,200
Yang!
Yang!

102
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:08,992
Yang?
Yang?

103
00:10:42,367 --> 00:10:43,992
你为什么要回来?
Why'd you have to come back?

104
00:10:44,034 --> 00:10:45,117
Penny不要!
Penny, no!

105
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:47,117
你为什么不吸取教训呢?
Why didn't you just learn your lesson?

106
00:10:50,117 --> 00:10:51,409
噢 Penny
Oh, Penny.

107
00:10:53,659 --> 00:10:54,284
我当然有吸取教训
I did.

108
00:10:54,325 --> 00:10:54,367
我当然有吸取教训

109
00:12:11,034 --> 00:12:14,034
瓦因 至少有一个人上来了
Vine, glad someone made it.

110
00:12:14,409 --> 00:12:15,367
你去放哨确认没人尾随
Watch for a tail,

111
00:12:15,409 --> 00:12:17,409
我要确定这玩意儿还携带武器
I need to make sure this thing is still armed.

112
00:12:23,742 --> 00:12:24,909
我已经不太确定
I'm no longer certain

113
00:12:24,950 --> 00:12:26,950
这是最合逻辑的方式了
this is the most logical course of action.

114
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,284
你确定要这么做吗 泽科?
Do you really wanna do this, Zeki?

115
00:12:31,117 --> 00:12:32,617
不 我不想
No, I don't.

116
00:12:33,367 --> 00:12:36,200
哈利特 将军已经不再有主导权
Harriet, the general is no longer in charge.

117
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:38,700
Ruby他们拿到了神杖
Ruby and the others have used the Staff.

118
00:12:39,117 --> 00:12:43,117
擎天正在坠落 但它的人民是安全的
Atlas is falling, but its people will be safe.

119
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:43,867
除非你
Unless you-

120
00:12:43,909 --> 00:12:47,075
这是原则问题 瓦因! 这关系到忠诚
It's the principle, Vine! It's about loyalty.

121
00:12:47,117 --> 00:12:48,659
克洛弗明白这点
Clover understood that.

122
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:50,659
克洛弗能看透这些
Clover would see this through.

123
00:12:52,492 --> 00:12:54,325
那或许克洛弗也错了
Then perhaps Clover was wrong too.

124
00:12:54,367 --> 00:12:55,617
你怎么敢这么说!
Don't you dare!

125
00:12:56,075 --> 00:12:58,950
克洛弗他 他是
Clover was, he was-

126
00:13:00,450 --> 00:13:01,575
对你来说很重要的人
Important to you.

127
00:13:07,492 --> 00:13:10,075
哈利特 你并不是唯一一个
Harriet, you are not the only one.

128
00:13:43,075 --> 00:13:45,575
看来你还是要打着一架了
Looks like you're getting that fight after all.

129
00:14:05,534 --> 00:14:06,159
我再重复一遍
I repeat.

130
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:08,075
有人收到我的消息了吗?
Is anybody receiving these messages?

131
00:14:09,742 --> 00:14:12,034
有没有人能反馈撤离的状态?
Can anyone report status on the evacuation?

132
00:14:29,742 --> 00:14:32,200
这些年我追踪了不少黑影
I chased a lot of shadows over the years.

133
00:14:32,909 --> 00:14:34,867
一直都知道会有背叛
Always expecting betrayal.

134
00:14:36,242 --> 00:14:40,992
但我从未想到 背叛我的会是你
But never once did I think it would ever come from you.

135
00:14:43,409 --> 00:14:45,075
我知道什么对擎天最好
I know what's best for Atlas.

136
00:14:45,117 --> 00:14:48,409
而我会为了拿到神杖做任何事情
And I'm going to do whatever it takes to get that Staff.

137
00:14:49,284 --> 00:14:49,325
所以 就当这是我的最后一道命令
insider this my last

138
00:14:49,367 --> 00:14:52,325
所以 就当这是我的最后一道命令
So, consider this my last order.

139
00:14:53,950 --> 00:14:55,325
让开
Step aside.

140
00:15:00,034 --> 00:15:02,992
在面对王国的敌人时 我从来未曾退缩
I've neyer wavered in fighting the enemies of this kingdom.

141
00:15:05,242 --> 00:15:06,867
现在也必然不会
And I won't start now.

142
00:15:24,367 --> 00:15:25,242
我不行了
I'm spent.

143
00:15:25,659 --> 00:15:26,784
Penny在哪?
Where's Penny?

144
00:15:26,825 --> 00:15:28,492
她不能解决这个风暴吗?
Couldn't she deal with this storm?

145
00:15:28,909 --> 00:15:31,367
等等 Penny应该已经到这儿了
Wait, Penny should've been here by now.

146
00:15:31,825 --> 00:15:32,617
情况不对
Something's wrong.

147
00:15:34,825 --> 00:15:35,409
什么?
What?

148
00:15:35,784 --> 00:15:36,450
为什么我不能
Why can't I-

149
00:15:36,492 --> 00:15:37,367
哦 天呐
Oh dear...

150
00:15:38,075 --> 00:15:39,284
安布罗休思
Ambrosius.

151
00:15:39,909 --> 00:15:42,617
擎天和曼特城的人从一边进去
People enter from Atlas and Mantle on one side,

152
00:15:42,659 --> 00:15:44,284
然后从另一边出来
and leave on the other side,

153
00:15:44,325 --> 00:15:48,117
一张通往真空王国的单程票
with a one-way ticket to Vacuo.

154
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:49,159
我们回不去了
We can't go back

155
00:15:49,409 --> 00:15:50,492
传送门不让我们回去
The portal won't let us.